## 🎯 Project Purpose

The purpose of this project is to transform raw job-posting data into an **interactive business intelligence dashboard** that can help users understand the data-job market.

Rather than looking at individual job postings separately, the dashboard aggregates the data into meaningful dimensions such as:

```text
Demand
Salary
Time
Location
Benefits
Education
Employment Type
Job Platform
```

This makes it easier to identify patterns and compare career opportunities across different data roles.

